  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Much like how Devs have their tags, and PC/Quest users have theirs I would love to see a tag on someone's name like a world icon when they are in a world they created. I've ran into a few world creators without ever having known it and would have loved to talk to them about their world but I don't know the author of every world. So I'd love to see something like this implemented!",
